Z||000000||Scott||05-30-2001||01:29 AM||||I stumbled onto this site 'bout 3 weeks ago; after deciding that since I finally finished college, I should get my forlorn '85 SE back on the road.  In the last few weeks I have had the pleasure of meeting 2 very esteemed gentlemen: Fiero Dave & David Harper.<BR>Fiero Dave has helped me very much.  He is honest, pleasant, and an all around good guy.  I found him to have great prices and he even  GAVE me a few odds and ends that I needed. I would not hesitate to deal with again, and I highly recommend him.<BR>David Harper has GIVEN me two '84s with Dukes.  One even had a rebuilt motor with a new clutch, which will save me many $$$ and alot of time toward getting my '85 back on the road.  <BR>I owe these guys many thanks, and they have reaffirmed my faith in my fellow Fiero owners.||||reg||10
